          "user_thumbnail": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVGPJS6fZL_5m5PbDEWKjcPu9okT1nrXsbUidymGD50IeIJ_vvb=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",
          "description": "Here for a weekend lunch. It's on the rooftop and has a non-ac and AC seating and a party hall. We wanted to sit inside but they said AC was not working so we managed outside which seemed better. Nice seating arrangement just like all of the outlets with vibrant colors. We tried a few a Thali's , paneer pakoda and veg seekh kebab. The starters were food and so were the lassi and buttermilk. In the Thali , we found uncooked potatoes in Aloo sabzis. Chole, dal and paneer were all great. Service was ok, had to call the staff a couple of times. Service charge was added to the bill, when I requested them to remove it considering its optional and the saga with the AC, they refused saying it's automated billing and they can't exclude it which was just an excuse. There is also paan available for purchase and we opted for banarasi paan they gave us paan leaves that were almost grey as if they had dried or were not fresh, when we questioned them they said that's how banaras paan looks, considering I've been to banaras a few times and eaten banarasi paan a number of times, I can tell that was not true. Overall a one time visit.",
