          "user_thumbnail": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVM0i-R93P_CQ55yHrz9TXgBmjADshXOrtVE5TDy3dQhPtlALDK=s120-c-rp-mo-ba12-br100",
          "description": "I visited this place with my family and absolutely loved it. It brought back some memories of how we used to eat loaded parathas in our child in Punjab. The curd, parathas and even the green chutney was completely like it is prepared in Punjab side. The Gobhi paratha and the Aaloo paratha were both very delicious and well cooked.  The spiced cold drink was also very nice. Chole was so delicious as well. The quantity should be increased though. We even tried their paan corner and the person served us fresh mitha paan.\n\nThe one thing that I missed with the parathas was a well made punjabi achaar. If that would have been served along, I would rated the place 5 star. Will like to visit the place again some day.",
